  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Hashmukh Pralhad Kandiya Sathwara vs The State Of Maharashtra on 11 March, 2020 Author: Prakash D. Naik Bench: Prakash D. Naik Sajakali Jamadar 1 of 2 906-ABA-583-2020.doc In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Criminal Anticipatory Bail Application No. 583 Of 2020 Hashmukh Pralhad Kandiya Sathwara ...Applicant Versus The State of Maharashtra ...Respondent ..... Mr. Brijesh Shukla, Advocate for the Applicant. Mr. S. R. Agarkar, App for the Respondent - State. Mr. B. R. Adsul, Psi, Bhayandar Police Station, Thane, Present. ..... Coram : Prakash D. Naik, J. Date : 11th March, 2020 Pc : 1. This is an application for anticipatory bail in C.R. No. 30 of 2020 registered with Bhayandar Police Station, Thane for offences punishable under Sections 188, 272, 273 & 328 r/w Section 34 of Indian Penal Code r/w Sections 26(2)(i), 26(2)(iv), 30(2)(a), 27, 3(1), (zz) (v), r/w Section 59 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. 2 . Apparently the FIR was registered for offences which were bailable in nature.",
    "facts": "2 . Apparently the FIR was registered for offences which were bailable in nature. Subsequently Section 328 of Indian Penal Code has been invoked which is non-bailable.",
